{"seq":3,"slug":"i18n-performance-caching","title":"国际化性能与缓存","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/operations/i18n-performance-caching","wordCount":1538,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"国际化性能与缓存\">国际化性能与缓存</h1><p>CLDR locale 数据总量超过 40MB（JSON 解包后），ICU 数据文件在 25-30MB 量级。如果每次请求都从磁盘加载并解析 locale 数据，i18n 格式化会成为性能瓶颈。后端 i18n 性能优化的核心是：减少 locale 数据的加载频率、缩小运行时数据体积、让格式化操作命中缓存。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>编译时数据嵌入</strong>：ICU4X 的 <code>icu4x-datagen</code> 预选 locale+组件编译进二进制，运行时零 I/O</li>\n<li><strong>Formatter 实例缓存</strong>：创建格式化器实例的成本远高于调用它，缓存 <code>locale+options</code> 组合</li>\n<li><strong>URL 路径包含 locale</strong>：CDN 缓存键天然分离，避免 <code>Vary: Accept-Language</code> 的碎片化问题</li>\n<li><strong>原子热更新</strong>：CLDR/tzdata 更新通过 atomic swap + formatter 缓存清空，无需全量重部署</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"locale-数据加载策略\">locale 数据加载策略</h2><p>不同加载策略的性能特征：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>启动时间</th>\n<th>运行时延迟</th>\n<th>内存占用</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>启动时全量加载</td>\n<td>慢（秒级）</td>\n<td>零额外开销</td>\n<td>高（所有 locale 常驻）</td>\n<td>单体应用、少量 locale</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按需懒加载</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>首次使用有延迟</td>\n<td>中（只加载使用的）</td>\n<td>微服务、大量 locale</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编译时嵌入</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>零</td>\n<td>最低（只含需要的）</td>\n<td>ICU4X 模式、边缘计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外部服务</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>网络延迟</td>\n<td>零（服务端缓存）</td>\n<td>中心化 i18n 服务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>ICU4X 2.2 的编译时数据嵌入（compiled data）模式代表了性能最优解——通过 <code>icu4x-datagen</code> 工具预先选择需要的 locale 和组件，编译进二进制：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 只生成日语和英语的日期+数字格式化数据&#10;icu4x-datagen --locales ja en \\&#10;  --components datetime plurals decimal \\&#10;  --format mod --out src/icu_data/\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 只生成日语和英语的日期+数字格式化数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">icu4x-datagen</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --locales</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ja</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> en</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --components</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> datetime</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> plurals</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> decimal</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --format</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mod</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --out</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> src/icu_data/</span></span></code></pre></div><p>结果：二进制体积只增加所需数据的大小（通常 100KB-2MB，取决于 locale 数量），运行时零 I/O、零分配（zero-copy deserialization）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;Traditional (ICU4C/ICU4J)&quot;&#10;        A[Runtime] --&gt; B[Load .dat/.res file&lt;br/&gt;from disk/network]&#10;        B --&gt; C[Parse &amp; allocate]&#10;        C --&gt; D[Format operation]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;ICU4X compiled data&quot;&#10;        E[Runtime] --&gt; F[Direct memory access&lt;br/&gt;zero-copy from binary]&#10;        F --&gt; G[Format operation]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph \"Traditional (ICU4C/ICU4J)\"\n        A[Runtime] --&gt; B[Load .dat/.res file&lt;br/&gt;from disk/network]\n        B --&gt; C[Parse &amp; allocate]\n        C --&gt; D[Format operation]\n    end\n    subgraph \"ICU4X compiled data\"\n        E[Runtime] --&gt; F[Direct memory access&lt;br/&gt;zero-copy from binary]\n        F --&gt; G[Format operation]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"formatter-实例缓存\">Formatter 实例缓存</h2><p>创建格式化器实例的成本远高于调用它。ICU 的 <code>NumberFormatter</code> 和 <code>DateTimeFormatter</code> 在构造时会解析模式、加载 locale 数据、构建内部状态——这个初始化过程不应在每次格式化调用时重复。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// 错误：每次调用都创建新实例&#10;public String formatPrice(long amount, String currency, Locale locale) {&#10;    // 每次 new → 解析模式 + 加载数据 ≈ 100-500μs&#10;    NumberFormat fmt = NumberFormat.getCurrencyInstance(locale);&#10;    return fmt.format(amount / 100.0);&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 正确：缓存 formatter 实例&#10;private final ConcurrentHashMap&lt;String, NumberFormatter&gt; formatterCache&#10;    = new ConcurrentHashMap&lt;&gt;();&#10;&#10;public String formatPrice(long amount, String currency, Locale locale) {&#10;    String key = locale.toLanguageTag() + &quot;:&quot; + currency;&#10;    NumberFormatter fmt = formatterCache.computeIfAbsent(key, k -&gt;&#10;        NumberFormatter.withLocale(locale)&#10;            .unit(Currency.getInstance(currency))&#10;            .precision(Precision.currency(CurrencyUsage.STANDARD))&#10;    );&#10;    return fmt.format(amount).toString(); // 热路径 ≈ 1-5μs&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 错误：每次调用都创建新实例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> String </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">formatPrice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">long</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount, String currency, Locale locale) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 每次 new → 解析模式 + 加载数据 ≈ 100-500μs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    NumberFormat fmt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NumberFormat.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getCurrencyInstance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(locale);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fmt.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">format</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 正确：缓存 formatter 实例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> final</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ConcurrentHashMap</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">String, NumberFormatter</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> formatterCache</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ConcurrentHashMap&#x3C;>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> String </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">formatPrice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">long</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount, String currency, Locale locale) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    String key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> locale.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toLanguageTag</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \":\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> currency;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    NumberFormatter fmt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> formatterCache.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">computeIfAbsent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key, k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        NumberFormatter.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">withLocale</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(locale)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">unit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Currency.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getInstance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(currency))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">precision</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Precision.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">currency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(CurrencyUsage.STANDARD))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fmt.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">format</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toString</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 热路径 ≈ 1-5μs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Formatter 缓存的设计要点：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>考虑</th>\n<th>推荐</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>缓存键</td>\n<td>locale + format options 组合</td>\n<td>组合数有限，不会爆炸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线程安全</td>\n<td>ICU4J formatter 是线程安全的</td>\n<td><code>ConcurrentHashMap</code> 或单例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存上限</td>\n<td>10 locale × 5 options = 50 实例</td>\n<td>通常 &lt; 100 实例，无需淘汰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生命周期</td>\n<td>应用生命周期</td>\n<td>不需要 TTL（数据不变）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>ICU4X 的 Rust API 通过类型系统保证了这一点——<code>DateTimeFormatter</code> 一旦创建就是不可变的、<code>Send + Sync</code> 的，天然适合跨线程共享。</p>\n<h2 id=\"格式化结果缓存\">格式化结果缓存</h2><p>对于相同输入反复格式化的场景（如电商商品价格），可以缓存格式化结果：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>cache_key</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>hash</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>value</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>locale</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>format_options</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{cache\\_key} = \\text{hash}(\\text{value}, \\text{locale}, \\text{format\\_options})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cache_key</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">hash</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">value</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">locale</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">format_options</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 格式化结果的 LRU 缓存&#10;const formatCache = new LRUCache&lt;string, string&gt;({ max: 10000 });&#10;&#10;function cachedFormatCurrency(amount: bigint, currency: string, locale: string): string {&#10;  const key = `${amount}:${currency}:${locale}`;&#10;  let result = formatCache.get(key);&#10;  if (!result) {&#10;    result = formatCurrency(amount, currency, locale);&#10;    formatCache.set(key, result);&#10;  }&#10;  return result;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 格式化结果的 LRU 缓存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> formatCache</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LRUCache</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>({ max: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> cachedFormatCurrency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bigint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">currency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">locale</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}:${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">currency</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}:${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">locale</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> formatCache.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">result) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> formatCurrency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount, currency, locale);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    formatCache.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key, result);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>结果缓存的适用条件：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>条件</th>\n<th>适合缓存</th>\n<th>不适合缓存</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>输入基数</td>\n<td>有限的 value × locale 组合</td>\n<td>无限变化（如时间戳）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调用频率</td>\n<td>热 key 高频重复</td>\n<td>均匀分布无热点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一致性要求</td>\n<td>格式化结果不随时间变</td>\n<td>CLDR 版本升级后需失效</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"cdn-与多语言内容分发\">CDN 与多语言内容分发</h2><p>多语言静态内容（翻译后的 JSON 资源、本地化的 HTML 页面）通过 CDN 分发时的缓存策略：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[Client&lt;br/&gt;Accept-Language: ja] --&gt; B[CDN Edge]&#10;    B --&gt; C{Cache hit?&lt;br/&gt;key = path + locale}&#10;    C --&gt;|Hit| D[Return cached response]&#10;    C --&gt;|Miss| E[Origin Server]&#10;    E --&gt; F[Generate localized response]&#10;    F --&gt; B&#10;    B --&gt; D\">flowchart LR\n    A[Client&lt;br/&gt;Accept-Language: ja] --&gt; B[CDN Edge]\n    B --&gt; C{Cache hit?&lt;br/&gt;key = path + locale}\n    C --&gt;|Hit| D[Return cached response]\n    C --&gt;|Miss| E[Origin Server]\n    E --&gt; F[Generate localized response]\n    F --&gt; B\n    B --&gt; D</pre><p>缓存键策略选择：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>缓存键示例</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>URL 路径包含 locale</td>\n<td><code>/ja/api/products</code></td>\n<td>天然分离</td>\n<td>URL 膨胀</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Vary: Accept-Language</td>\n<td><code>/api/products</code> + Vary</td>\n<td>URL 简洁</td>\n<td>缓存碎片化严重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自定义 Header</td>\n<td><code>X-Locale: ja</code> → 缓存键</td>\n<td>灵活</td>\n<td>需 CDN 支持自定义键</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>Vary: Accept-Language</code> 的陷阱：浏览器发送的 <code>Accept-Language</code> 头组合数量巨大（<code>en-US,en;q=0.9,zh;q=0.8</code> vs <code>en-US,en;q=0.9</code>），导致缓存碎片化——相同内容的不同 Accept-Language 变体各自占用一份缓存。</p>\n<p>推荐方案：<strong>URL 路径包含 locale</strong> + CDN 只按路径（不按 Accept-Language）缓存。locale 协商在应用层完成后 redirect 到正确的 locale 路径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"翻译资源的加载优化\">翻译资源的加载优化</h2><p>前后端协作的翻译资源加载模式：</p>\n<p><strong>分割策略（Code Splitting for i18n）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 只加载当前页面需要的翻译 namespace&#10;async function loadTranslations(locale: string, page: string) {&#10;  const [common, pageSpecific] = await Promise.all([&#10;    import(`./locales/${locale}/common.json`),&#10;    import(`./locales/${locale}/${page}.json`),&#10;  ]);&#10;  return { ...common, ...pageSpecific };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 只加载当前页面需要的翻译 namespace</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> loadTranslations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">locale</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">page</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">common</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pageSpecific</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">all</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`./locales/${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">locale</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}/common.json`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`./locales/${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">locale</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}/${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">page</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}.json`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">common, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pageSpecific };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分割维度</th>\n<th>粒度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>按 locale</td>\n<td>一个文件包含一种语言的全部翻译</td>\n<td>小应用（&lt;500 keys）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按 namespace/page</td>\n<td>每页只加载相关翻译</td>\n<td>大应用、SPA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按优先级</td>\n<td>首屏翻译 vs 延迟加载翻译</td>\n<td>性能敏感场景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>后端 API 支持按需加载翻译的端点设计：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"GET /api/i18n/translations?locale=ja&amp;ns=checkout,common&#10;→ 只返回 checkout 和 common namespace 的日语翻译\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>GET /api/i18n/translations?locale=ja&#x26;ns=checkout,common</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>→ 只返回 checkout 和 common namespace 的日语翻译</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"性能基准与监控\">性能基准与监控</h2><p>i18n 相关的性能指标应纳入 APM 监控：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>目标</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Locale resolution p99</td>\n<td>&lt;1ms</td>\n<td>中间件解析 + 匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NumberFormat p99</td>\n<td>&lt;50μs</td>\n<td>单次格式化调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DateTimeFormat p99</td>\n<td>&lt;100μs</td>\n<td>单次格式化调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Translation lookup p99</td>\n<td>&lt;10μs</td>\n<td>key → localized string</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Locale data load time</td>\n<td>&lt;100ms</td>\n<td>冷启动首次加载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Translation bundle size</td>\n<td>&lt;50KB/locale</td>\n<td>网络传输量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>ICU4X 2.2 的性能基准（官方 benchmark，2026 年 4 月数据）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>ICU4C 76</th>\n<th>ICU4X 2.0</th>\n<th>ICU4X 2.2</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DateTimeFormatter 创建</td>\n<td>基准</td>\n<td>~1.2x 快</td>\n<td>~1.3x 快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DateTimeFormatter 调用</td>\n<td>基准</td>\n<td>~1.1x 快</td>\n<td>~1.2x 快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存占用</td>\n<td>基准</td>\n<td>50-60% 减少</td>\n<td>55-65% 减少</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二进制体积</td>\n<td>基准</td>\n<td>70-80% 减少</td>\n<td>75-85% 减少</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这些数据表明，对于新建后端服务，ICU4X 在性能和资源占用上已经是优于传统 ICU4C 的选择——且 Rust 的内存安全消除了 C/C++ i18n 库的缓冲区溢出风险。</p>\n<h2 id=\"locale-数据热更新\">locale 数据热更新</h2><p>生产环境中 CLDR/tzdata 更新不应需要完整重部署。热更新策略：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant S as Service Instance&#10;    participant C as Config Server&#10;    participant D as Data Store&#10;&#10;    Note over C: New CLDR 48.2 data available&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: Push notification: new version&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;D: Download new locale data bundle&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;S: Atomic swap: old data → new data&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;S: Invalidate formatter cache&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;C: ACK: updated to v48.2\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant S as Service Instance\n    participant C as Config Server\n    participant D as Data Store\n\n    Note over C: New CLDR 48.2 data available\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: Push notification: new version\n    S-&gt;&gt;D: Download new locale data bundle\n    S-&gt;&gt;S: Atomic swap: old data → new data\n    S-&gt;&gt;S: Invalidate formatter cache\n    S-&gt;&gt;C: ACK: updated to v48.2</pre><p>原子替换确保不会出现请求处理到一半时数据版本切换。Go 的 <code>atomic.Value</code> 和 Java 的 <code>volatile</code> 引用适合存放 locale 数据的版本指针。Formatter 缓存在数据更新后必须清空——因为 CLDR 版本升级可能改变格式化规则。</p>\n<p>整体架构设计（包括中心化 vs 分布式 i18n 服务的选择如何影响缓存策略）参见<a href=\"../foundations/i18n-architecture-patterns\">国际化架构模式</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>i18n 性能优化的三个层次：数据加载（编译时嵌入 &gt; 懒加载 &gt; 全量预加载）、实例缓存（formatter 创建成本远高于调用，缓存 locale+options 组合）、结果缓存（有限基数的高频格式化场景）。CDN 层使用 URL 路径包含 locale 的方案避免 Vary 碎片化。ICU4X 2.2 的性能数据表明 Rust 实现在 DateTimeFormatter 创建和调用上已优于 ICU4C，同时内存占用减少 55-65%、二进制体积减少 75-85%。locale 数据热更新通过原子替换+缓存清空实现，确保 CLDR/tzdata 升级不需全量重部署。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"国际化性能与缓存","id":"国际化性能与缓存"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"locale 数据加载策略","id":"locale-数据加载策略"},{"level":2,"text":"Formatter 实例缓存","id":"formatter-实例缓存"},{"level":2,"text":"格式化结果缓存","id":"格式化结果缓存"},{"level":2,"text":"CDN 与多语言内容分发","id":"cdn-与多语言内容分发"},{"level":2,"text":"翻译资源的加载优化","id":"翻译资源的加载优化"},{"level":2,"text":"性能基准与监控","id":"性能基准与监控"},{"level":2,"text":"locale 数据热更新","id":"locale-数据热更新"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"RTL 与双向文本支持","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/operations/rtl-bidirectional-support"},"next":null}